{"type":"message","id":"5f73fd8d","parentId":"8175b315","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:41:07.960Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so we're going back in time. Let me get a sense of how many pages we need.\n\nEach page goes back about 6 days. To get from 2025-04-18 to the beginning of the notes (which could be years ago), we'd need a lot of pages.\n\nBut the key question is: when did this user start using Get笔记? If they've been using it for 2-3 years, we'd need thousands of pages.\n\nHowever, looking at the v5 session result from yesterday - it said \"has_more=false\" after scanning 20 pages. But today when I scan from the last cursor, it still shows \"has_more=true\". This is confusing.\n \nWait, I think I see what's happening. The scan sessions from yesterday must have started from a much older cursor value and scanned forward through 20 pages of newer notes. The current notes I'm looking at (around April 2025) are actually newer than where those previous scans left off, which is why there's still more to retrieve.\n\nBut if yesterday's scan hit \"has_more=false\" at page 20, that suggests they reached the end of the note stream at that time. The issue is that new notes could have been created since yesterday, which would explain why I'm seeing more notes available now. Or there's something about how the pagination works that I'm not fully grasping yet.\n\nRather than keep trying to reverse-engineer the logic, I should just check the quota usage from the API response headers to see if I can actually make another request and continue from where I left off.","thinkingSignature":"6ab92e7adf7142dfa0b962da84f7e4e9cac5054d8a5ad0d01942f5f52a7e3eb0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0pd7ix7rx81d_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check quota from response headers\ncurl -s -I \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id=0\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\" \\\n  -H \"X-Client-ID: cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\" 2>&1 | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43814,"output":465,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84795,"cost":{"input":0.0131442,"output":0.000558,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01613316}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775608850855,"responseId":"0624d713cfd2cda34808c12cd6e1aaec"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e0ed6621","parentId":"5f73fd8d","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:41:08.384Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0pd7ix7rx81d_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"HTTP/1.1 405 Method Not Allowed\r\nDate: Wed, 08 Apr 2026 00:41:08 GMT\r\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8\r\nContent-Length: 1345\r\nConnection: keep-alive\r\nSet-Cookie: aliyungf_tc=4fa986c99d237d1c455399ae2a59c2a05fce545ff85d85d9a54af46439d1e6a7; Path=/; HttpOnly\r\nSet-Cookie: acw_tc=781bad5917756088683165380e00877361d922f304b8619b3ace8923afa33e;path=/;HttpOnly;Max-Age=1800\r\nG-Powered-By: ddgw/1.15.11\r\nG-Timestamp: 1775608868"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":344,"aggregated":"HTTP/1.1 405 Method Not Allowed\r\nDate: Wed, 08 Apr 2026 00:41:08 GMT\r\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8\r\nContent-Length: 1345\r\nConnection: keep-alive\r\nSet-Cookie: aliyungf_tc=4fa986c99d237d1c455399ae2a59c2a05fce545ff85d85d9a54af46439d1e6a7; Path=/; HttpOnly\r\nSet-Cookie: acw_tc=781bad5917756088683165380e00877361d922f304b8619b3ace8923afa33e;path=/;HttpOnly;Max-Age=1800\r\nG-Powered-By: ddgw/1.15.11\r\nG-Timestamp: 1775608868","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775608868360}}
{"type":"message","id":"629e55da","parentId":"e0ed6621","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:41:23.839Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"HEAD请求不行，让我直接获取一下带quota信息的响应。之前看到的响应结构里应该有rate_limit信息。让我检查一下最近一次API调用里有没有rate_limit信息。\n\n实际上，我需要理解这个扫描任务的意义。昨天说还有\"4000+篇较老的散放笔记未扫\"，但现在扫描的结果显示最旧的笔记是2025-03-31（一年前的）。这个账户总共只有7389篇笔记。\n\n让我算一下：- 总笔记：7389篇- 昨天扫描了多少：各个session加起来大约400-500篇- 剩余：约6900篇\n\n\n如果用倒序扫描，每次20篇，需要约345次API调用，消耗345次读取配额。按每天1000次的限制，大约两天就能扫完。不过这个任务其实不适合在对话里做，应该写成脚本在后台运行，然后汇总结果。\n\n但我注意到一个奇怪的现象：昨天有subagent的session显示\"has_more=false\"，但今天的扫描却还有更多笔记。这可能是因为在扫描过程中有新笔记被创建了，或者扫描的起点不同导致的。\n\n不管怎样，我应该继续扫描。今天的任务是补充无标题笔记的标题，我需要先确认Get笔记的API是否支持批量更新操作。","thinkingSignature":"e9781bc2833c2a6148adef8ca44b4e465e7514e1450f111c4c6efe5ca1a7b012"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uj3gldfs4xun_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/getnote/references/list.md","offset":1}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":44481,"output":292,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85289,"cost":{"input":0.0133443,"output":0.0003504,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01612566}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775608868385,"responseId":"0624d72488d5e7106b744184ca4b1cd1"}}
{"type":"message","id":"fbf700b1","parentId":"629e55da","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:41:23.987Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_uj3gldfs4xun_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 笔记列表与详情\n\n## 概述\n\n浏览笔记列表、查看详情（含原文/转写）、更新笔记内容、删除笔记。\n\n---\n\n## 笔记列表\n\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id=0\n```\n\n参数：\n- `since_id` (int64, 必填) - 游标，首次传 `0`，后续用上次返回的 `next_cursor`\n\n返回：`notes[]`、`has_more`、`next_cursor`、`total`（每次固定 20 条）\n\n> ⚠️ **响应 JSON 可能包含未转义的控制字符**（笔记 content 中的原始换行符），建议用支持容错解析的 JSON 库处理。\n\n> ⚠️ **`id`、`next_cursor`、`parent_id` 均为 int64**，JavaScript 环境必须在 `JSON.parse` 前做字符串化处理（见主文档「笔记 ID 处理规则」）。务必用字符串保存这些值，后续操作直接透传字符串即可。\n\n**笔记类型 note_type**：\n\n| 值 | 说明 |\n|----|------|\n| `plain_text` | 纯文本 |\n| `img_text` | 图片笔记 |\n| `link` | 链接笔记 |\n| `audio` | 即时录音 |\n| `meeting` | 会议录音 |\n| `local_audio` | 本地音频 |\n| `internal_record` | 内录音频 |\n| `class_audio` | 课堂录音 |\n| `recorder_audio` | 录音卡长录 |\n| `recorder_flash_audio` | 录音卡闪念 |\n\n---\n\n## 笔记详情\n\n```\nGET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/detail?id={note_id}\n```\n\n参数：\n- `id` (int64, 必填) - 笔记 ID\n- `image_quality` (string, 可选) - 传 `original` 返回正文中图片的原图链接（无压缩）\n\n**⚠️ 返回结构**：数据在 `data.note` 对象下，不是 `data` 直接取：\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"note\": {\n      \"id\": \"1234567890\",\n      \"note_id\": \"1234567890\",\n      \"title\": \"笔记标题\",\n      \"content\": \"笔记内容\",\n      \"tags\": [...],\n      ...\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**字段说明**：\n- `note_id` (string) - 笔记 ID 的字符串格式，便于 AI Agent 解析，避免 int64 精度问题\n- `children_ids` (string[]) - 子笔记 ID 列表（字符串格式），仅当有子笔记时返回\n\n**图片附件**：`attachments[]` 中每个图片包含：\n- `url` - 缩略图 URL（720px 压缩）\n- `original_url` - 原图 URL（无压缩，适合需要高清图的场景）\n\n**正文原图**：传 `image_quality=original` 时，`content` 中的 markdown 图片链接会返回原图（去掉 OSS 压缩参数）。\n\n**详情独有字段**（列表不返回）：`audio.original`、`audio.play_url`、`audio.duration`、`web_page.content`、`web_page.url`、`web_page.excerpt`、`attachments[]`、`children_ids`。\n\n完整字段说明见 [api-details.md](api-details.md#笔记详情独有字段)。\n\n---\n\n## 更新笔记\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/update\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"note_id\": 123456789,\n  \"title\": \"新标题\",\n  \"content\": \"新的 Markdown 内容\",\n  \"tags\": [\"标签1\", \"标签2\"]\n}\n```\n\n参数说明：\n- `note_id` (int64, **必填**) - 要更新的笔记 ID\n- `title` (string, 可选) - 新标题，不传则不更新\n- `content` (string, 可选) - 新内容，不传则不更新\n- `tags` (string[], 可选) - 新标签列表，**替换**原有标签（不传则保持原标签）\n\n> ⚠️ **至少需要传 title、content、tags 中的一个**，否则返回错误。\n\n> ⚠️ **仅支持 plain_text 类型笔记**，链接笔记、图片笔记等暂不支持更新。\n\n---\n\n## 删除笔记\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/delete\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\"note_id\": 123456789}\n```\n\n笔记移入回收站，需要 `note.content.trash` scope。\n\n---\n\n## 展示模板\n\n列表展示：\n> 📋 最近 {N} 条笔记：\n>\n> 1. **{title}** · {note_type} · {created_at}\n> 2. ...\n>\n> （回复笔记序号或标题可查看详情）\n\n详情展示（链接笔记）：\n> 📄 **{title}**\n> 🔗 来源：{web_page.url}\n> 📝 摘要：{content}\n> 🏷️ 标签：{tags}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775608883966}}
{"type":"message","id":"60d07c59","parentId":"fbf700b1","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:42:48.390Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so the update API supports updating the title. I can use this to add titles to notes that don't have them. The issue is that I need to:\n1. First scan the notes to find ones without titles\n2. Then update each one\n\nBut with 7389 notes and limited API quota (1000/day), I need to be strategic.\n\nLet me think about what makes sense to do right now in this chat:\n1. The P2 task (补充无标题笔记标题) - this requires scanning all 7389 notes to find the ones without titles, which would use 370 API calls just for scanning, plus more for updates\n2. The P3 task (标签去重整理) - this also requires scanning\n\n\n3. The overall scan - this is a large task\n\nGiven the scope, I think the best approach is to run a background script that handles the entire workflow end-to-end, since the user specifically asked to continue from yesterday's work. I'll write a Python script that scans through notes without titles, generates appropriate titles using AI, and updates them, all while being mindful of quota constraints.\n\nBut first, let me clarify where yesterday's scan actually ended. Looking at the session data, I was checking the kb-full-migration-v5 session to see if it continued from cursor 1873611189678932616 and what the final results were. Looking at the session results, the v5 scan actually reached the end of notes with `has_more=false` after 20 pages, but we're only seeing notes from April 2025 - so there's likely a separate older dataset that hasn't been scanned yet.\n\nI should just proceed with the scan using the Python approach rather than trying to parse heredoc syntax inexec, since the user wants to continue from where we left off yesterday with the remaining 4000+ older notes.\n\nGiven the quota constraints, I'll write a Python script that scans in larger batches of 100 notes at a time and sleeps between requests to avoid hitting rate limits, then runs it in the background while I focus on analyzing what we've already captured.","thinkingSignature":"b05a99d1aab6c39b6005c108ca272c169ec87db2c54ba2955b7edd5bb5556bd7"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，我直接开始继续扫描。鉴于笔记总数7389篇，这个工作量比较大，我会用后台方式跑。让我先写一个全面的扫描脚本：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_hlv5hbyvgi2t_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/tmp/scan_and_title_notes.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nGet笔记 扫描 + 无标题笔记补全脚本\n继续昨天的未完成工作\nCursor: 1873611189678932616\n\"\"\"\nimport urllib.request\nimport urllib.error\nimport json\nimport re\nimport time\nimport os\n\n# ========== 配置 ==========\nAUTH = \"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nCLIENT_ID = \"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\nBASE_URL = \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource\"\n\nOUTPUT_DIR = \"/tmp/getnote_scan\"\nos.makedirs(OUTPUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n\n# 跳过的前缀\nSKIP_PREFIXES = [\n    \"🌱 发芽日报\",\n    \"🌱 发芽报告\",\n    \"📦 每日备份报告\",\n    \"📦 OpenClaw 每日备份报告\",\n    \"OpenClaw 每日备份报告\",\n    \"每日复盘\",\n    \"## 每日复盘\",\n    \"## 每日发芽\",\n    \"🦐 发芽报告\",\n]\n\n# 知识库 ID\nKB_IDS = {\n    \"芯片业务相关\": \"9YeBam0m\",\n    \"OpenClaw使用\": \"G0P1Z51J\",\n    \"家庭教育\": \"EJX1r7bn\",\n}\n\n# ========== 工具函数 ==========\ndef fix_int64(text):\n    \"\"\"修复 int64 精度问题\"\"\"\n    return re.sub(\n        r'\"(id|note_id|next_cursor|parent_id|follow_id|live_id)\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)',\n        r'\"\\1\":\"\\2\"',\n        text\n    )\n\ndef api_get(path, params=None):\n    \"\"\"GET 请求\"\"\"\n    url = f\"{BASE_URL}{path}\"\n    if params:\n        url += \"?\" + \"&\".join(f\"{k}={v}\" for k, v in params.items())\n    \n    req = urllib.request.Request(url)\n    req.add_header(\"Authorization\", AUTH)\n    req.add_header(\"X-Client-ID\", CLIENT_ID)\n    \n    for attempt in range(3):\n        try:\n            with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=15) as resp:\n                text = resp.read().decode(\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n                return json.loads(fix_int64(text))\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"  [WARN] GET {path} 失败 (attempt {attempt+1}): {e}\")\n            time.sleep(2)\n    return None\n\ndef api_post(path, data):\n    \"\"\"POST 请求\"\"\"\n    url = f\"{BASE_URL}{path}\"\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, data=json.dumps(data).encode(), method=\"POST\")\n    req.add_header(\"Authorization\", AUTH)\n    req.add_header(\"X-Client-ID\", CLIENT_ID)\n    req.add_header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n    \n    for attempt in range(3):\n        try:\n            with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=15) as resp:\n                text = resp.read().decode(\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n                return json.loads(fix_int64(text))\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"  [WARN] POST {path} 失败 (attempt {attempt+1}): {e}\")\n            time.sleep(2)\n    return None\n\ndef should_skip(title):\n    \"\"\"检查是否应该跳过\"\"\"\n    if not title:\n        return True\n    for prefix in SKIP_PREFIXES:\n        if title.startswith(prefix):\n            return True\n    return False\n\ndef generate_title(content, note_type):\n    \"\"\"根据内容生成标题（简单规则）\"\"\"\n    if not content:\n        return \"\"\n    \n    # 取前100个字符\n    first_line = content.strip().split(\"\\n\")[0]\n    first_line = first_line.strip(\"#-* \").replace(\"#\", \"\").strip()\n    \n    if not first_line:\n        return \"\"\n    \n    # 截断到30字\n    if len(first_line) > 30:\n        title = first_line[:30] + \"…\"\n    else:\n        title = first_line\n    \n    return title\n\ndef analyze_note_for_kb(content, tags):\n    \"\"\"根据内容判断应该进入哪个知识库\"\"\"\n    content_lower = (content or \"\").lower()\n    tags_str = \",\".join([t.get(\"name\", \"\") for t in (tags or [])]).lower()\n    combined = content_lower + \" \" + tags_str\n    \n    # 芯片相关\n    chip_keywords = [\"芯片\", \"半导体\", \"ecdn\", \"ear\", \"出口管制\", \"半导体\", \n                     \"fab\", \"封装\", \"测试\", \"良率\", \"供应商\", \"质量\", \"芯片\",\n                     \"transistor\", \"semiconductor\", \" wafer\", \"foundry\"]\n    if any(k in combined for k in chip_keywords):\n        return \"芯片业务相关\"\n    \n    # OpenClaw/AI工具相关\n    ai_keywords = [\"openclaw\", \"agent\", \"skill\", \"chatgpt\", \"deepseek\", \"claude\",\n                   \"大模型\", \"AI工具\", \"提示词\", \"prompt\", \"工作流\", \"自动化\"]\n    if any(k in combined for k in ai_keywords):\n        return \"OpenClaw使用\"\n    \n    # 家庭教育\n    edu_keywords = [\"兮兮\", \"中考\", \"英语\", \"语文\", \"数学\", \"物理\", \"化学\",\n                   \"生物\", \"地理\", \"学习\", \"教育\", \"成绩\", \"考试\", \"错题\",\n                   \"青春期\", \"亲子\", \"家长\"]\n    if any(k in combined for k in edu_keywords):\n        return \"家庭教育\"\n    \n    return None\n\n# ========== 主扫描流程 ==========\ndef scan_and_process(cursor_start, max_pages=500, delay=0.5):\n    \"\"\"\n    扫描笔记，找到无标题的，尝试生成标题并更新\n    \"\"\"\n    cursor = cursor_start\n    page = 0\n    stats = {\n        \"total\": 0,\n        \"scanned\": 0,\n        \"skipped\": 0,\n        \"no_title\": 0,\n        \"titled\": 0,\n        \"errors\": 0,\n        \"kb_chip\": 0,\n        \"kb_openclaw\": 0,\n        \"kb_edu\": 0,\n    }\n    \n    no_title_notes = []\n    \n    print(f\"=== 开始扫描 from cursor {cursor} (最多 {max_pages} 页) ===\")\n    print(f\"开始时间: {time.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')}\")\n    \n    while page < max_pages:\n        page += 1\n        result = api_get(\"/note/list\", {\"since_id\": cursor})\n        \n        if not result or not result.get(\"success\"):\n            print(f\"\\n[WARN] Page {page} 请求失败，跳过\")\n            stats[\"errors\"] += 1\n            time.sleep(2)\n            continue\n        \n        data = result.get(\"data\", {})\n        notes = data.get(\"notes\", [])\n        has_more = data.get(\"has_more\", False)\n        next_cursor = data.get(\"next_cursor\")\n        \n        if not notes:\n            print(f\"\\n[INFO] Page {page}: 无笔记，扫描结束\")\n            break\n        \n        stats[\"total\"] = data.get(\"total\", 0)\n        \n        for note in notes:\n            stats[\"scanned\"] += 1\n            note_id = str(note.get(\"id\", \"\"))\n            title = note.get(\"title\", \"\") or \"\"\n            content = note.get(\"content\", \"\") or \"\"\n            note_type = note.get(\"note_type\", \"\")\n            tags = note.get(\"tags\", [])\n            created = note.get(\"created_at\", \"\")\n            \n            # 跳过系统生成内容\n            if should_skip(title):\n                stats[\"skipped\"] += 1\n                continue\n            \n            # 记录无标题笔记\n            if not title:\n                stats[\"no_title\"] += 1\n                no_title_notes.append({\n                    \"id\": note_id,\n                    \"type\": note_type,\n                    \"content\": content[:200],\n                    \"created\": created,\n                    \"suggested_title\": generate_title(content, note_type)\n                })\n            else:\n                # 有标题，分析是否需要迁移到KB\n                kb = analyze_note_for_kb(content, tags)\n                if kb:\n                    stats[f\"kb_{'chip' if kb == '芯片业务相关' else 'openclaw' if kb == 'OpenClaw使用' else 'edu'}\"] += 1\n        \n        print(f\"Page {page}: 扫描 {stats['scanned']} 篇 | 无标题: {stats['no_title']} | 跳过: {stats['skipped']} | KB待定: chip={stats['kb_chip']} oc={stats['kb_openclaw']} edu={stats['kb_edu']} | cursor={next_cursor}\")\n        \n        if not has_more or not next_cursor:\n            print(f\"\\n[INFO] 已到末尾，扫描结束\")\n            break\n        \n        cursor = next_cursor\n        time.sleep(delay)\n    \n    # 保存结果\n    result_file = f\"{OUTPUT_DIR}/scan_result_{int(time.time())}.json\"\n    with open(result_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump({\n            \"stats\": stats,\n            \"no_title_notes\": no_title_notes,\n            \"final_cursor\": cursor,\n            \"pages_scanned\": page\n        }, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n    \n    print(f\"\\n=== 扫描完成 ===\")\n    print(f\"总笔记: {stats['total']}\")\n    print(f\"扫描页数: {page}\")\n    print(f\"扫描笔记数: {stats['scanned']}\")\n    print(f\"无标题笔记: {stats['no_title']}\")\n    print(f\"结果保存: {result_file}\")\n    print(f\"最终 cursor: {cursor}\")\n    \n    return stats, no_title_notes, cursor\n\n# ========== 无标题笔记处理 ==========\ndef process_no_title_notes(notes, delay=1.0):\n    \"\"\"为无标题笔记生成并更新标题\"\"\"\n    updated = 0\n    failed = 0\n    \n    # 暂时跳过更新（因为需要AI生成标题，这里只记录）\n    # 后续可以批量处理\n    for note in notes[:20]:  # 先处理前20条\n        note_id = note[\"id\"]\n        suggested = note.get(\"suggested_title\", \"\")\n        content_preview = note.get(\"content\", \"\")[:100]\n        \n        print(f\"  [{note_id}] 建议标题: {suggested}\")\n        print(f\"    内容预览: {content_preview[:80]}...\")\n        \n        # 如果有建议标题，尝试更新\n        if suggested:\n            # 注：这里需要 AI 生成更好的标题\n            # 暂时只打印，不实际调用更新\n            pass\n        \n    print(f\"\\n本次跳过自动更新（如需更新请用 AI 辅助生成标题后批量更新）\")\n    return updated, failed\n\n# ========== 主入口 ==========\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    \n    # 继续昨天的扫描\n    # 最后记录的 cursor\n    LAST_CURSOR = \"1873611189678932616\"\n    \n    # 可以通过命令行参数指定 cursor\n    cursor = sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) > 1 else LAST_CURSOR\n    max_pages = int(sys.argv[2]) if len(sys.argv) > 2 else 500\n    \n    print(f\"继续扫描 from cursor: {cursor}\")\n    \n    # 第一阶段：扫描\n    stats, no_title_notes, final_cursor = scan_and_process(cursor, max_pages=max_pages)\n    \n    # 第二阶段：处理无标题笔记\n    if no_title_notes:\n        print(f\"\\n=== 处理 {len(no_title_notes)} 条无标题笔记 ===\")\n        process_no_title_notes(no_title_notes)\n    \n    print(f\"\\n最终 cursor (下次继续): {final_cursor}\")\n    print(f\"提示：将上面的 cursor 写入 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md 作为记录\")"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":45837,"output":3064,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89417,"cost":{"input":0.013751099999999999,"output":0.0036768,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01985886}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775608883988,"responseId":"0624d734da7d76f4cc2cc4a76385b88b"}}
