{"type":"message","id":"bbd0bcad","parentId":"269269f4","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:43:46.167Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - in the 5 pages of recent notes (from 2025-04), there are 0 notes without titles. This suggests that:\n\n1. Recent notes (2025-04 onward) already have titles\n2. The \"无标题笔记\" problem might be in the older notes (from before 2025-04)\n\nLet me scan some older notes to check. Let me look at notes from much earlier periods.","thinkingSignature":"6fafe8a161cd35d9dddca64e4e9adf59d98787336e73cd43db525925a1ef6f26"},{"type":"text","text":"前100篇最近笔记都没有无标题的。让我抽查一些更早的笔记，看看无标题问题主要在哪个时期：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_z2wu2gurtyta_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 扫描更早的笔记，看看无标题的情况\npython3 << 'EOF'\nimport urllib.request, json, re, time\n\nAUTH = \"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nCLIENT_ID = \"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\ndef fix_int64(text):\n    return re.sub(r'\"(id|note_id|next_cursor|parent_id|follow_id|live_id)\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)', r'\"\\1\":\"\\2\"', text)\n\ndef api_get(since_id):\n    url = f\"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id={since_id}\"\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url)\n    req.add_header(\"Authorization\", AUTH)\n    req.add_header(\"X-Client-ID\", CLIENT_ID)\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=15) as resp:\n        return json.loads(fix_int64(resp.read().decode()))\n\n# 扫描几个不同的历史时期\ncursors_to_check = [\n    (\"最近\", \"0\"),\n    (\"2025-04月初\", \"1870466956864404784\"),\n    (\"2025-03月中\", \"1860000000000000000\"),\n    (\"2025-01月\", \"1840000000000000000\"),\n    (\"2024年\", \"1800000000000000000\"),\n    (\"早期\", \"1500000000000000000\"),\n]\n\nSKIP_PREFIXES = [\"🌱 发芽日报\",\"🌱 发芽报告\",\"📦 每日备份报告\",\"📦 OpenClaw 每日备份报告\",\"每日复盘\",\"## 每日复盘\",\"🦐 发芽报告\",\"OpenClaw 每日备份报告\"]\n\nfor label, cursor in cursors_to_check:\n    result = api_get(cursor)\n    if not result.get(\"success\"):\n        print(f\"{label}: API失败\")\n        continue\n    notes = result.get(\"data\", {}).get(\"notes\", [])\n    if not notes:\n        print(f\"{label}: 无笔记\")\n        continue\n    \n    total = len(notes)\n    no_title = sum(1 for n in notes if not (n.get(\"title\") or \"\"))\n    skipped = sum(1 for n in notes if any((n.get(\"title\") or \"\").startswith(p) for p in SKIP_PREFIXES))\n    titled = total - no_title - skipped\n    \n    oldest = notes[-1].get(\"created_at\", \"\")\n    newest = notes[0].get(\"created_at\", \"\")\n    print(f\"{label} ({newest[:10]}~{oldest[:10]}): 共{total}篇 | 有标题={titled} | 无标题={no_title} | 跳过={skipped}\")\n    time.sleep(0.3)\nEOF","background":false,"timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50403,"output":783,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91702,"cost":{"input":0.0151209,"output":0.0009396,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.018491459999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775609008633,"responseId":"0624d7b0df4e5a862880a5022c45ec56"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3764ca88","parentId":"bbd0bcad","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:43:53.505Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_z2wu2gurtyta_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"最近 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5\n2025-04月初 (2025-03-15~2025-03-12): 共20篇 | 有标题=15 | 无标题=5 | 跳过=0\n2025-03月中 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5\n2025-01月 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5\n2024年 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5\n早期 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":7234,"aggregated":"最近 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5\n2025-04月初 (2025-03-15~2025-03-12): 共20篇 | 有标题=15 | 无标题=5 | 跳过=0\n2025-03月中 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5\n2025-01月 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5\n2024年 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5\n早期 (2026-04-08~2026-04-07): 共20篇 | 有标题=11 | 无标题=4 | 跳过=5","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775609033480}}
{"type":"message","id":"8f36bb76","parentId":"3764ca88","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:44:24.155Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Something is wrong - all the \"older\" cursors are returning the same recent notes (2026-04-08~2026-04-07). This means the `since_id` parameter doesn't work the way I expected. It seems like when you pass a very old `since_id`, the API just returns the most recent notes instead of going back in time.\n\nThis explains the confusion about \"has_more=false\" in yesterday's sessions. If `since_id=0` returns the newest notes and you paginate with `next_cursor`, you eventually get to the oldest notes. But passing an old cursor directly doesn't seem to go back in time - it might just return recent notes.\n\nWait, but earlier when I called with `since_id=1873611189678932616` (which was the last cursor from yesterday), I got older notes (2025-04-18). And when I called with `since_id=1873076662745312464` I got even older notes (2025-04-12). And with `since_id=1872504678328649472` I got notes from 2025-04-06. So the pagination IS working backward through time.\n\nBut when I try to call with `since_id=1860000000000000000` (which would be from 2025-03), I'm still getting recent notes. This suggests that the cursor values have to be actual cursors that were returned by the API - they might not be chronological IDs, or there might be gaps in the sequence.\n\nActually, I think the real issue is that the `id` values are actually timestamps in snowflake format, so a cursor from 2025-03 would theoretically be lower than one from 2025-04. But when I pass `1860000000000000000`, the API might be treating it as \"get notes after this ID\" rather than \"get notes from this time period,\" and since that ID doesn't exist or is before the start of the dataset, it just returns the newest notes instead.\n\nLet me think about this differently. Each note has a unique ID and a timestamp, and when I paginate through `since_id=0` I get notes in reverse chronological order with `next_cursor` pointing to the oldest note from that batch. So if I'm getting recent notes from 2026-04-07 when passing an old ID, the API might not be handling the timestamp-to-cursor mapping correctly.\n\nI should just accept that pagination through `next_cursor` is the only reliable method and continue from where I left off. I'm noticing there are actually 4 notes without titles even in the most recent batch, so I need to figure out which notes still need titles assigned. I'll run a larger scan using the `next_cursor` approach to map out the title coverage across different time periods.","thinkingSignature":"3baa3fa221cd095dd9e570c76a6c0810f3e03f616c773be19d1c45a9bdfb5253"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ozxjdyh4nf84_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 用 next_cursor 方式正确向后扫描，获取不同时间段的分布\npython3 << 'EOF'\nimport urllib.request, json, re, time\n\nAUTH = \"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nCLIENT_ID = \"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\ndef fix_int64(text):\n    return re.sub(r'\"(id|note_id|next_cursor|parent_id|follow_id|live_id)\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)', r'\"\\1\":\"\\2\"', text)\n\ndef api_get(since_id):\n    url = f\"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id={since_id}\"\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url)\n    req.add_header(\"Authorization\", AUTH)\n    req.add_header(\"X-Client-ID\", CLIENT_ID)\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=15) as resp:\n        return json.loads(fix_int64(resp.read().decode()))\n\nSKIP_PREFIXES = [\"🌱 发芽日报\",\"🌱 发芽报告\",\"📦 每日备份报告\",\"每日复盘\",\"## 每日复盘\",\"🦐 发芽报告\",\"OpenClaw 每日备份报告\"]\n\n# 从最新开始，记录每个时间段的标题情况\ncursor = \"0\"\nall_no_title = []\nperiods_checked = []\n\nfor i in range(8):\n    result = api_get(cursor)\n    if not result.get(\"success\"):\n        print(f\"Page {i+1}: 失败\")\n        break\n    data = result.get(\"data\", {})\n    notes = data.get(\"notes\", [])\n    next_cursor = data.get(\"next_cursor\", \"\")\n    \n    if not notes:\n        print(f\"Page {i+1}: 无笔记\")\n        break\n    \n    total = len(notes)\n    no_title = [n for n in notes if not (n.get(\"title\") or \"\")]\n    skipped = [n for n in notes if any((n.get(\"title\") or \"\").startswith(p) for p in SKIP_PREFIXES)]\n    titled = total - len(no_title) - len(skipped)\n    \n    oldest = notes[-1].get(\"created_at\", \"\")[:10]\n    newest = notes[0].get(\"created_at\", \"\")[:10]\n    print(f\"Page {i+1} ({newest} ~ {oldest}): 共{total} | 有标题={titled} | 无标题={len(no_title)} | 跳过={len(skipped)}\")\n    \n    for n in no_title:\n        all_no_title.append({\n            \"id\": n.get(\"id\"),\n            \"type\": n.get(\"note_type\"),\n            \"created\": n.get(\"created_at\"),\n            \"content\": (n.get(\"content\") or \"\")[:100]\n        })\n    \n    periods_checked.append({\n        \"newest\": newest,\n        \"oldest\": oldest,\n        \"titled\": titled,\n        \"no_title\": len(no_title),\n        \"skipped\": len(skipped)\n    })\n    \n    if not next_cursor:\n        print(\"已到末尾\")\n        break\n    \n    cursor = next_cursor\n    time.sleep(0.3)\n\nprint(f\"\\n=== 无标题笔记汇总 ({len(all_no_title)} 条) ===\")\nfor n in all_no_title[:10]:\n    print(f\"  [{n['id']}] {n['type']} | {n['created'][:19]} | {n['content'][:60]}...\")\n\n# 保存结果\nwith open(\"/tmp/no_title_summary.json\", \"w\") as f:\n    json.dump({\"periods\": periods_checked, \"no_title_notes\": all_no_title}, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nprint(f\"\\n结果已保存到 /tmp/no_title_summary.json\")\nprint(f\"最终 cursor: {cursor}\")\nEOF","background":false,"timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":51425,"output":1472,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93413,"cost":{"input":0.015427499999999999,"output":0.0017664,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.019624859999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775609033506,"responseId":"0624d7cadc51edae41a34e7779b23951"}}
