{"type":"message","id":"4bc3468b","parentId":"f4c1ca4d","timestamp":"2026-04-08T01:10:17.491Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me spawn a subagent to continue with P4 - knowledge base supplementary migration. I need to read the memory file to get context on what was already done.","thinkingSignature":"fc5fa4ba1bc390ea53c7652a4ece78110791d09a830b1cda3599d075f73fe571"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_20uw0i6xp707_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"继续 Get笔记 P4 知识库补充迁移任务。\n\n## 背景\n昨天已完成 KB 重组和部分迁移。今天继续补充迁移扫描中发现的散放有价值笔记。\n\n## API 配置\n- Authorization: gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\n- X-Client-ID: cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\n- Base URL: https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource\n\n## 目标知识库\n- 芯片 KB (9YeBam0m)：芯片/半导体/质量/供应链相关内容\n- OpenClaw KB (G0P1Z51J)：OpenClaw/AI工具/Agent/工作流相关内容\n- 家庭教育 KB (EJX1r7bn)：兮兮/中考/英语/学习/亲子相关内容\n\n## Get笔记 API\n- 列表：GET /note/list?since_id={cursor}（每次20条）\n- 详情：GET /note/detail?id={note_id}\n- 入库：POST /resource/topic/add（参数：topic_id=KB_ID, note_id=笔记ID）\n\n## 判断规则\nplain_text 类型 + 包含以下关键词：\n- 芯片KB：芯片、半导体、ecdn、ear、出口管制、封装、测试、良率、供应商、质量\n- OpenClaw KB：openclaw、agent、skill、chatgpt、deepseek、claude、大模型、AI工具、提示词\n- 家庭教育KB：兮兮、中考、英语、语文、数学、物理、化学、生物、地理、学习、教育、成绩、考试、错题、青春期、亲子\n\n## 扫描策略\n1. 从 cursor 1873611189678932616 继续（已扫描过约9700条，今天新扫4000条）\n2. 扫描剩余未覆盖的笔记（约 2000 条，到 cursor 1850511050601039697 截止）\n3. 每天最多跑 500 次 API，留 500 次配额防超限\n4. 跳过前缀：🌱发芽日报/报告、📦每日备份报告、每日复盘、🦐发芽报告、OpenClaw每日备份报告\n\n## 判断后入库\n- 获取详情确认内容后，调用 topic/add 接口入对应 KB\n- 每天最多入 50 条（write_note 每日配额限制）\n\n## 完成标准\n1. 扫描完所有未覆盖笔记（约 2000 条）\n2. 识别并入库有价值笔记\n3. 最终 cursor 和入库数量写入 /tmp/getnote_p4_status.md\n4. 发送飞书消息给频哥（ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83）汇报\n\n## 飞书消息格式\n标题：Get笔记 P4 任务完成\n内容：简短总结（扫描量、入库量、最终 cursor）","label":"getnote-p4-migration","runtime":"subagent","mode":"run"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":728