{"type":"message","id":"f6c65222","parentId":"fff3c5de","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:35:56.019Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63c4ab10-b6d5-498e-9047-fbe3c1118442.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63c4ab10-b6d5-498e-9047-fbe3c1118442.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-04-08 16:35:53 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b525578b310acc2a1b66badca633, post, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b525578b310acc2a1b66badca633\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-08 16:35 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63c4ab10-b6d5-498e-9047-fbe3c1118442.jpg\n12、13题作为错题计入错题本"}],"timestamp":1775637355991}}
{"type":"message","id":"ab47bfed","parentId":"f6c65222","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:36:05.263Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent an image and wants questions 12 and 13 to be added to the error notebook (错题本). Let me first look at the image to identify the questions.","thinkingSignature":"7a683559c56493837258d9b1317cf74e28a5dad903c089d5b0479be89818896f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ti2sjb2rekwc_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请识别这张图片中的所有题目，特别是第12题和第13题。图片看起来是生物或地理试卷的一部分。请完整提取题目内容和选项。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63c4ab10-b6d5-498e-9047-fbe3c1118442.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":135,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":113463,"totalTokens":113728,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.00016199999999999998,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.042548625,"total":0.042749625}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775637356016,"responseId":"0625466c6d787fb3b963f358ff2d494a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"89643d9a","parentId":"ab47bfed","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:38:01.738Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ti2sjb2rekwc_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片展示的是初中物理试卷中的两道选择题，涉及大气压强的测量和液体压强的平衡。以下是题目内容的完整提取：\n\n### **第12题**\n\n**题目：**\n12. 如图所示，是用注射器、弹簧测力计等估测大气压的值的装置，下列说法中错误的是（ ）\nA. 该实验选择横截面积小的注射器是考虑到学生用的弹簧测力计量程不够大\nB. 实验前先将活塞推至注射器筒的底端，是为了排尽筒内的空气\nC. 用注射器容积除以注射器的全部长度 $L$，可求出活塞的横截面积\nD. 测得的大气压值偏小，可能是因为注射器筒内的空气没有排尽\n\n---\n\n### **第13题**\n\n**题目：**\n13. 如图所示，取一根横截面积为 $1\\text{ cm}^2$ 的直筒塑料管，在其底部扎上轻质橡皮膜后向管内倒入 $15\\text{ g}$ 水，使它竖直静止于某液体中，观察到橡皮膜恰好变平时管外液面比管内液面低 $3\\text{ cm}$。$g$ 取 $10\\text{ N/kg}$，水的密度为 $1.0 \\times 10^3\\text{ kg/m}^3$。下列说法错误的是（ ）\nA. 水对塑料管底部橡皮膜的压力大小为 $0.15\\text{ N}$\nB. 管外液体的密度是 $1.25 \\times 10^3\\text{ kg/m}^3$\nC. 管外液体对橡皮膜产生的压强大小为 $1.5 \\times 10^3\\text{ Pa}$\nD. 若将塑料管下压少许，则橡皮膜会向上凹陷\n\n---\n\n### **简要解析（供参考）：**\n\n*   **第12题：** \n    *   **C选项是错误的。** 计算横截面积应该用注射器的容积除以“有刻度部分的长度”，而不是“全部长度 $L$”，因为注射器两端通常还有不带刻度的部分。\n    *   图片中学生在括号内填了“A”，并在B、C、D旁打了勾，这可能是学生的做题记录。\n\n*   **第13题：**\n    *   **A正确：** $F = G = mg = 0.015\\text{ kg} \\times 10\\text{ N/kg} = 0.15\\text{ N}$。\n    *   **C正确：** 内部压强 $p_{\\text{内}} = F/S = 0.15\\text{ N} / (1 \\times 10^{-4}\\text{ m}^2) = 1500\\text{ Pa} = 1.5 \\times 10^3\\text{ Pa}$。\n    *   **B正确：** 水柱高度 $h_{\\text{水}} = 15\\text{ cm}$，管外液体高度 $h_{\\text{液}} = 15\\text{ cm} - 3\\text{ cm} = 12\\text{ cm}$。根据 $p_{\\text{内}} = p_{\\text{外}}$，$\\rho_{\\text{水}} g h_{\\text{水}} = \\rho_{\\text{液}} g h_{\\text{液}}$，得 $\\rho_{\\text{液}} = (15/12) \\rho_{\\text{水}} = 1.25 \\times 10^3\\text{ kg/m}^3$。\n    *   **D错误：** 塑料管下压时，外部液体的压强增加量大于内部（内部压强不变，因为水柱高度相对于膜没变），所以膜受到的向上压力变大，会**向上凸起**。\n    *   图片中学生在括号内填了“D”，这是正确的答案选择。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63c4ab10-b6d5-498e-9047-fbe3c1118442.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775637481700}}
