{"type":"message","id":"d2f7d938","parentId":"b7547ceb","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:54:16.765Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to try again - likely referring to uploading the image and creating the error log entries for questions 24 and 25. Let me proceed with creating the records.","thinkingSignature":"6db995581570ff160f8c3174c2bb9883130cbc853e058face8e3e7267382d091"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_k15udgqi4wld_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1","table_id":"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz","fields":{"学科":"物理","题目内容":"24. 将瓶子从正放变为倒放后，水对瓶盖的压力______，水对瓶盖的压强______。（选填\"变小\"、\"不变\"或\"变大\"）","正确答案":"压力变小，压强变大","错因分析":"锥形瓶倒放后，瓶盖端受压面积减小，虽然液体深度增加导致压强增大，但压力F=pS，由于受力面积大幅减小，最终压力反而变小。这是锥形容器特有的压力特性。","知识点":["压强"],"难度":"⭐⭐","原图":[{"file_token":"AGkHbo6CnoLZR1xFIjdcFlUmnmc"}]}}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":283,"cacheRead":124770,"cacheWrite":1194,"totalTokens":126377,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.00033959999999999996,"cacheRead":0.007486199999999999,"cacheWrite":0.00044775,"total":0.00831255}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775638444241,"responseId":"06254aac081b5a5cc6d92e96262e6f52"}}
