{"type":"message","id":"54d05926","parentId":"d45b7ffb","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:54:29.256Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create the record for question 25.","thinkingSignature":"a5d1b419daa7956fcccc700d2905ebca67aaaa9a88009e747746d4308937d720"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9tkjftgkjzfl_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1","table_id":"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz","fields":{"学科":"物理","题目内容":"25. 海姆立克急救法：急救者从背后环抱患者，用力快速挤压患者的腹腔，上推隔膜，挤压胸腔，促使异物排出。上推患者的隔膜时，胸腔容积______（选填\"缩小\"或\"扩大\"），胸腔内气压______（选填\"大于\"或\"小于\"）外界大气压。","正确答案":"胸腔容积缩小，大于外界大气压","错因分析":"上推隔膜→胸腔体积缩小→根据玻义耳定律PV=k，胸内气压增大。当胸内气压>外界气压时，肺内气体被压出，将异物冲出。易错点：误以为压缩体积气压变小，或混淆容积与气压的关系。","知识点":["压强"],"难度":"⭐⭐","原图":[{"file_token":"AGkHbo6CnoLZR1xFIjdcFlUmnmc"}]}}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":86093,"output":307,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":126916,"cost":{"input":0.025827899999999997,"output":0.0003684,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.028627259999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775638459874,"responseId":"06254abc73460ceb411be7d7d78f64f9"}}
