{"type":"message","id":"8fca8949","parentId":"27a9b833","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:26:16.689Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to add question 28(2) to the wrong question notebook. Let me upload the image and create the record.\n\nQuestion 28(2): A wood block slides down a left slope, then on a horizontal surface, then up a right slope. The question asks to draw the friction force of the block on the ground at point B.\n\nThe key错因 here is:\n1. **受力物体错误**: 题目要求画\"木块对地面的摩擦力\"（作用在地面上），但学生画成了\"地面对木块的摩擦力\"（作用点在木块上）\n2. **方向错误**: 木块向右运动，地面对木块的摩擦力向左；根据牛顿第三定律，木块给地面的摩擦力方向应该是向右\n\nSo the correct answer for the错因分析 should focus on:\n- 混淆了\"物体受到的力\"和\"物体对外的作用力\"\n- 没有注意摩擦力的受力物体和分析对象\n- 作用点应该画在地面上，不是木块上","thinkingSignature":"3f43a721497638942370e19d64bdfd22661fde2b4a9a9b841715699707bf6f98"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w2zl179r54nv_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/7f3854ca-d2c6-44d3-9752-556865001347.jpg /var/folders/8r/0b88l2d52ys5974p0fms08mr0000gn/T/xi_bad_28_2.jpg && echo \"ok\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":307,"cacheRead":128748,"cacheWrite":697,"totalTokens":129882,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0003684,"cacheRead":0.007724879999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000261375,"total":0.008393654999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775640364666,"responseId":"0625522d8a991969f48190cb5fde5108"}}
