{"type":"message","id":"10da6532","parentId":"20f973d1","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:26:41.771Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Record created successfully.","thinkingSignature":"7f91c822aa9a57ad2fea2054795491ce829880e87aacf898fde29925d90a9f6f"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ 已录入错题本！\n\n**第28(2)题**（力学作图）\n- 正确答案：摩擦力方向**向右**，作用点在**地面**\n- 错因：**受力物体混淆**——题目要求画\"木块**对**地面\"的摩擦力（作用在地面），学生错画成\"地面对木块\"的摩擦力（作用点在木块）\n- 关键点：作用力和反作用力方向相反，不能搞混\n- 难度：⭐⭐\n\n这个题是个经典易错点——题目问\"对XX的力\"，受力物体就是XX，作用点要画在XX上 💪"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":90249,"output":142,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":130907,"cost":{"input":0.0270747,"output":0.0001704,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02967606}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775640395470,"responseId":"0625524b00339c6733cda6c6b4fcb501"}}
{"type":"message","id":"eefa789e","parentId":"10da6532","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:29:03.171Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-08 17:29:01 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b5255b3763fe8c2b5d9ae9590bad]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5255b3763fe8c2b5d9ae9590bad\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-08 17:29 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n再补充一个信息：\n地面对木块的摩擦力：阻碍木块运动，方向应 向左 \n木块对地面的摩擦力：与上面那个力是一对相互作用力，方向应 向右"}],"timestamp":1775640543142}}
