{"type":"message","id":"0a243720","parentId":"8c0db8b2","timestamp":"2026-04-08T12:02:36.750Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate images for each of the 4 physics problems using the image_generate tool. The user said to use English for labels. Let me generate 4 images, one for each question.\n\nQ1: Block on table - show pressure on table and normal force on block\nQ2: Block being pulled by rope to the right\nQ3: Car moving right and braking\nQ4: Conveyor belt carrying goods upward\n\nLet me generate these images.","thinkingSignature":"ad0409a1411396c782d5b058ae8ae92523c1e38825cba4f9c1e94d0e636cdde1"},{"type":"text","text":"好，我来生成4道题的配图：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_06x6y94dn6ln_1","name":"image_generate","arguments":{"prompt":"Simple physics diagram for a middle school student. Two separate diagrams side by side.\n\nLeft diagram titled \"Q1-1\": A rectangular wooden block sitting on top of a horizontal table. An arrow points vertically DOWNWARD from the center of the block toward the table surface. Label the arrow \"F压\" (pressure force).\n\nRight diagram titled \"Q1-2\": A rectangular wooden block sitting on top of a horizontal table. An arrow points vertically UPWARD from the center of the block. Label the arrow \"N\" (normal force).\n\nUse simple black outlines on white background. Clean and clear for physics textbook use. Labels in English/simplified Chinese."}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":262,"cacheRead":143794,"cacheWrite":679,"totalTokens":144865,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0003144,"cacheRead":0.008627639999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000254625,"total":0.009235664999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775649746151,"responseId":"062576d26ab22d3041c9d3ef3e16d10d"}}
